WEBVTT

00:00:03.290 --> 00:00:04.560
<i>Oh, wow...</i>

00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:06.760
<i>He took out all those insects alone?</i>

00:00:06.760 --> 00:00:08.150
<i>He's amazing!</i>

00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:09.380
<i>Alone?</i>

00:01:34.940 --> 00:01:36.950
<b>Koishikawa Medical Facility</b>

00:01:38.810 --> 00:01:40.480
Is anyone in fighting shape?

00:01:46.740 --> 00:01:51.130
The Samurai House Patrol 
cannot send any more men.

00:01:51.130 --> 00:01:53.400
Well done, everyone.

00:01:54.060 --> 00:01:55.140
Oogami-dono!

00:01:55.740 --> 00:01:57.840
Leave the rest to me.

00:02:00.790 --> 00:02:04.890
<i>We vowed we would protect Edo. 
We have shamed ourselves!</i>

00:02:12.700 --> 00:02:14.940
<i>Tsukishima, until your return,</i>

00:02:15.400 --> 00:02:19.270
<i>I shall display the pride 
of the Samurai House Patrol!</i>

00:02:23.880 --> 00:02:25.270
No way.

00:02:26.150 --> 00:02:28.960
Everyone, prepare to fight as soon as we land!

00:02:29.280 --> 00:02:30.050
Right!

00:02:30.050 --> 00:02:30.980
Huh?

00:02:33.520 --> 00:02:36.550
<b>Training with Father! 
The Thirty-six Blades of Fuji!!</b>

00:02:38.700 --> 00:02:42.050
<b>Edo Castle</b>

00:02:40.290 --> 00:02:42.050
Please escape, Yoshimune-sama...

00:02:42.120 --> 00:02:45.560
<b>Tokugawa Yoshimune, Eighth Shogun</b>

00:02:42.750 --> 00:02:45.560
Do not allow a trivial concern to unsettle you.

00:02:46.360 --> 00:02:47.880
Yoshimune-sama?

00:02:49.580 --> 00:02:53.060
<i>Yes, this is but a taste of what is to come.</i>

00:02:53.960 --> 00:02:55.380
<i>A greater fight awaits</i>

00:02:55.380 --> 00:02:59.430
<i>against the forces of the West...</i>

00:03:00.840 --> 00:03:02.080
Out of the way!

00:03:02.080 --> 00:03:03.640
Stop, Ieshige-sama!

00:03:03.640 --> 00:03:05.350
Do not touch me!

00:03:05.350 --> 00:03:08.450
I must aid my friend,
 Jinbei, with his task.

00:03:09.160 --> 00:03:09.960
Jinbei?

00:03:10.410 --> 00:03:14.190
But have you trained with 
a blade, Ieshige-sama?

00:03:14.190 --> 00:03:14.970
No!

00:03:14.970 --> 00:03:16.840
Have you ever even sliced fruit?

00:03:16.840 --> 00:03:18.460
No!

00:03:18.460 --> 00:03:21.220
But I have much knowledge at my disposal.

00:03:21.220 --> 00:03:25.540
What we know as swordsmanship 
began as the Togoku Seven style,

00:03:25.540 --> 00:03:29.440
which seven priests disseminated 
throughout the Togoku region.

00:03:30.380 --> 00:03:35.070
I shall use this knowledge to protect his home!

00:03:36.360 --> 00:03:37.480
<i>Until Jinbei...</i>

00:03:38.070 --> 00:03:39.300
<i>Until Tsukishima...</i>

00:03:40.170 --> 00:03:41.820
<i>...returns.</i>

00:03:45.490 --> 00:03:46.530
Miss!

00:03:46.820 --> 00:03:47.980
Run away!

00:03:49.220 --> 00:03:51.660
Someone, save her!

00:03:55.790 --> 00:03:57.030
Jinbei-sama!

00:04:02.910 --> 00:04:05.350
<i>Always be ready for a fight!</i>

00:04:10.330 --> 00:04:12.310
Oharu-dono, are you all right?

00:04:13.250 --> 00:04:14.750
Jinbei-sama...

00:04:16.110 --> 00:04:17.690
I knew you'd come.

00:04:17.690 --> 00:04:19.090
This way.

00:04:29.370 --> 00:04:30.620
Oh, wow...

00:04:31.950 --> 00:04:32.620
What's this?

00:04:33.720 --> 00:04:35.360
So many!

00:04:36.800 --> 00:04:38.990
He took out all those insects alone?

00:04:38.990 --> 00:04:40.540
He's amazing!

00:04:41.130 --> 00:04:42.090
Alone?

00:04:50.920 --> 00:04:52.430
How have you been,

00:04:54.650 --> 00:04:55.560
Jinbei?

00:04:56.060 --> 00:04:58.200
F-Father!

00:04:58.200 --> 00:04:58.960
Huh?

00:04:59.960 --> 00:05:01.820
Father!

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:03.280
Jinbei!

00:05:04.440 --> 00:05:05.780
Father!

00:05:06.610 --> 00:05:09.620
You've left your middle exposed, you fool!

00:05:12.530 --> 00:05:13.970
You require more training.

00:05:14.240 --> 00:05:15.750
A samurai is always ready for a fight.

00:05:16.390 --> 00:05:19.130
You never know when 
you're about to go into battle.

00:05:19.340 --> 00:05:22.630
Thank you for reminding me!

00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:24.140
Very well!

00:05:24.140 --> 00:05:27.000
We shall test your improvement.

00:05:27.510 --> 00:05:29.140
Yes, Father!

00:05:34.410 --> 00:05:35.700
Now, then...

00:05:35.700 --> 00:05:40.480
Let us celebrate our success at 
Hachijo Island and our defense of Edo!

00:05:40.480 --> 00:05:41.700
Cheers!

00:05:41.700 --> 00:05:43.740
Cheers!

00:05:44.930 --> 00:05:48.370
Thank you for inviting me.

00:05:48.370 --> 00:05:50.410
Not at all, Genjuurou-dono.

00:05:51.090 --> 00:05:56.100
This celebration was only made 
possible due to your efforts.

00:05:57.330 --> 00:06:02.000
Normally, I would never drink 
with one of the lower classes.

00:06:02.500 --> 00:06:06.210
Anyway, you're really good,
 Genjuurou-sama.

00:06:06.210 --> 00:06:07.660
I was so impressed...

00:06:07.660 --> 00:06:09.940
Please train me sometime!

00:06:10.870 --> 00:06:12.010
If you like.

00:06:13.260 --> 00:06:14.660
Me, too...

00:06:14.660 --> 00:06:15.520
And me.

00:06:16.910 --> 00:06:19.200
Your dad's really popular.

00:06:19.610 --> 00:06:20.890
It's been a while.

00:06:20.890 --> 00:06:22.640
Don't you want to talk to him?

00:06:22.640 --> 00:06:25.530
No, we said all we needed
 with our blades.

00:06:25.530 --> 00:06:27.530
You spoke with your blades?

00:06:27.960 --> 00:06:31.040
But all you did was 
get your butt kicked...

00:06:31.040 --> 00:06:34.500
No, this is how we normally communicate.

00:06:35.120 --> 00:06:37.940
Your family life is pretty rough.

00:06:37.940 --> 00:06:41.750
Anyway, what happened at 
Hachijo Island, everyone?

00:06:41.750 --> 00:06:43.420
You really don't remember?

00:06:43.420 --> 00:06:44.550
No...

00:06:44.550 --> 00:06:47.430
Unfortunately, I barely remember a thing.

00:06:47.430 --> 00:06:49.430
What ended up happening?

00:06:58.120 --> 00:07:02.240
<i>Listen, I need to look into Jinbei-kun.</i>

00:07:02.790 --> 00:07:04.810
<i>But for now, don't tell him anything.</i>

00:07:08.080 --> 00:07:12.020
All I remember is fighting the 
Insect Hunters for a while,

00:07:12.020 --> 00:07:15.320
and meeting the Magistrate's servant.

00:07:15.320 --> 00:07:16.730
Servant?

00:07:16.730 --> 00:07:17.930
Oh, right!

00:07:17.930 --> 00:07:19.580
Where is the Magistrate?

00:07:20.140 --> 00:07:23.710
I must meet with the Magistrate 
and see to something.

00:07:23.960 --> 00:07:26.350
What are you talking about?

00:07:26.350 --> 00:07:29.050
People of our rank can't meet 
with someone like that.

00:07:31.620 --> 00:07:32.630
We can't?

00:07:35.480 --> 00:07:36.510
Jinbei!

00:07:36.700 --> 00:07:38.560
Nagatomimaru-dono!

00:07:38.560 --> 00:07:40.590
You're all right...

00:07:40.590 --> 00:07:42.020
I missed you!

00:07:46.620 --> 00:07:47.700
Jinbei!

00:07:49.810 --> 00:07:50.650
Father...

00:07:52.220 --> 00:07:53.920
Edo is a good place, isn't it?

00:07:53.920 --> 00:07:54.660
Yes.

00:07:55.060 --> 00:07:57.950
Jinbei, what have you learned here?

00:07:59.030 --> 00:08:00.790
You left a while ago.

00:08:00.790 --> 00:08:01.890
Tell me.

00:08:03.320 --> 00:08:05.470
Something important...

00:08:06.550 --> 00:08:09.210
I learned that I am weak.

00:08:10.890 --> 00:08:12.990
Ever since I arrived in Edo,

00:08:12.990 --> 00:08:16.350
others have repeatedly had to save 
me because of my weakness.

00:08:18.990 --> 00:08:22.890
I'm certain that, back on Hachijo Island, I lost!

00:08:23.920 --> 00:08:28.910
Even though my job is to protect the 
Insect Magistrate and the people of Edo...

00:08:29.460 --> 00:08:31.610
I am sorry, Father!

00:08:31.610 --> 00:08:32.900
My weakness...

00:08:32.900 --> 00:08:34.430
My weakness has damaged

00:08:34.430 --> 00:08:38.910
the reputation of the Tsukishima style 
you've worked so hard to build...

00:08:39.370 --> 00:08:40.690
I am

00:08:41.370 --> 00:08:43.910
so very sorry!

00:08:45.660 --> 00:08:46.730
Jinbei...

00:08:47.540 --> 00:08:50.690
I never gave you the right to name yourself

00:08:51.710 --> 00:08:53.300
a Tsukishima-style practitioner!

00:08:54.480 --> 00:08:57.970
For quite some time, I've known you are weak.

00:08:57.970 --> 00:08:59.980
How could you imagine yourself

00:08:59.980 --> 00:09:03.960
able to damage the Tsukishima style's reputation,

00:09:03.960 --> 00:09:06.630
when you have yet to master it?!

00:09:06.630 --> 00:09:08.950
I'm s-sorry!

00:09:08.950 --> 00:09:10.060
You must train!

00:09:10.060 --> 00:09:12.230
Tomorrow, we leave on a training journey.

00:09:13.250 --> 00:09:14.240
Yes, sir!

00:09:18.160 --> 00:09:19.830
What happened to Tsukishima

00:09:20.230 --> 00:09:24.910
may have begun when my 
hair fell into his mouth.

00:09:26.190 --> 00:09:31.130
But no normal human would 
change in such a way.

00:09:34.980 --> 00:09:37.070
I shall be blunt.

00:09:37.070 --> 00:09:39.970
Is he an Insect Hunter like yourself?

00:09:41.890 --> 00:09:44.100
I have no need to answer that question.

00:09:45.530 --> 00:09:47.680
Be more concerned with your own safety.

00:09:49.710 --> 00:09:53.360
At the moment, you have no power, correct?

00:10:07.460 --> 00:10:08.510
I see...

00:10:08.930 --> 00:10:13.380
I had forgotten how lonely it is here.

00:10:14.740 --> 00:10:18.750
What is Tsukishima doing now?

00:10:32.440 --> 00:10:33.770
<i>Tsukishima,</i>

00:10:34.120 --> 00:10:38.740
<i>you reminded me
of my own humanity.</i>

00:10:39.300 --> 00:10:42.870
<i>But I never even gave you my name,</i>

00:10:42.870 --> 00:10:45.180
<i>and I believed you to be an enemy.</i>

00:10:46.220 --> 00:10:48.750
<i>At least allow me to apologize...</i>

00:10:49.920 --> 00:10:51.610
<i>If I can do that,</i>

00:10:51.610 --> 00:10:55.840
<i>then even if I can never 
leave that place again...</i>

00:11:05.000 --> 00:11:06.490
<i>T-Tsukishima?</i>

00:11:09.580 --> 00:11:10.890
Jinbei-sama?

00:11:11.480 --> 00:11:12.430
Oharu-dono,

00:11:12.430 --> 00:11:14.910
thank you for bringing me some food.

00:11:14.910 --> 00:11:15.830
Not at all.

00:11:22.760 --> 00:11:24.240
Jinbei-sama?

00:11:24.240 --> 00:11:27.340
You're leaving for training
 tomorrow morning, right?

00:11:27.340 --> 00:11:29.000
Shouldn't you be resting?

00:11:29.340 --> 00:11:30.260
No...

00:11:30.260 --> 00:11:35.800
I must be as strong as possible for 
Edo and the Insect Magistrate.

00:11:45.640 --> 00:11:48.660
Sun-sama, good morning!

00:11:48.660 --> 00:11:50.180
Good morning!

00:11:50.740 --> 00:11:51.540
Let's go.

00:11:51.540 --> 00:11:52.140
Yes.

00:11:55.470 --> 00:11:59.650
<i>I must grow much stronger
 during this training!</i>

00:12:00.430 --> 00:12:02.700
Swim across all the surrounding lakes!

00:12:02.700 --> 00:12:04.160
Yes, Father!

00:12:04.720 --> 00:12:07.590
We'll gather food in Mt. Fuji's forests.

00:12:07.590 --> 00:12:08.910
Yes, Father.

00:12:09.440 --> 00:12:11.620
Carry that to Mt. Fuji's summit!

00:12:11.620 --> 00:12:13.420
Yes, Father...

00:12:14.520 --> 00:12:19.420
<b>Mt. Fuji's Peak</b>

00:12:14.620 --> 00:12:16.150
I shall now teach you

00:12:16.150 --> 00:12:19.420
the Tsukishima style's secret techniques.

00:12:19.900 --> 00:12:24.680
Y-You mean the Thirty-Six Blades of Fuji, Father?

00:12:24.970 --> 00:12:26.060
That's correct.

00:12:27.020 --> 00:12:29.280
At last, at last...

00:12:29.280 --> 00:12:32.170
Listen, the Thirty-Six Blades of Fuji are...

00:12:32.170 --> 00:12:38.250
A set of techniques you created in your youth.

00:12:38.250 --> 00:12:42.440
Some are capable of splitting the sea itself—

00:12:44.600 --> 00:12:46.620
Don't steal my lines!

00:12:47.290 --> 00:12:51.260
Matsunohara Kotori-dono gave you 
three days before you must return.

00:12:51.730 --> 00:12:55.700
During that time, you will learn all thirty-six.

00:12:55.970 --> 00:12:57.380
A-All of them?

00:12:57.920 --> 00:12:59.970
And then, Jinbei...

00:12:59.970 --> 00:13:03.920
You will be able to truly call yourself 
a master of the Tsukishima style.

00:13:04.550 --> 00:13:08.930
F-F-F-Father!

00:13:14.840 --> 00:13:16.490
Watch well, Jinbei...

00:13:16.490 --> 00:13:19.940
This is the Fuji technique you must learn now.

00:13:26.010 --> 00:13:30.280
<i>Tsukishima-style: Fuji Hammer!</i>

00:13:31.640 --> 00:13:35.790
He's slashing, but it looks as if he's 
smashing it with a hammer.

00:13:36.460 --> 00:13:39.540
Father's favorite technique, the Fuji Hammer!

00:13:45.790 --> 00:13:46.800
Here it comes.

00:13:46.800 --> 00:13:47.680
Stand back.

00:13:54.860 --> 00:13:58.500
Did you cause Mt. Fuji to erupt, Father?

00:13:58.500 --> 00:14:00.290
Now, Jinbei...

00:14:02.400 --> 00:14:06.610
Use the Fuji Hammer right here, 
to halt the eruption.

00:14:06.950 --> 00:14:08.990
Wh-What?

00:14:09.550 --> 00:14:11.890
If you use the Fuji Hammer here,

00:14:11.890 --> 00:14:15.000
it will seal the path of the eruption.

00:14:16.130 --> 00:14:19.320
By the look of it, you have three 
days until the lava overflows.

00:14:19.680 --> 00:14:24.000
In other words, if you cannot learn 
the Fuji Hammer in that time,

00:14:24.690 --> 00:14:28.010
the cities at the mountain's base will burn.

00:14:28.350 --> 00:14:30.980
What was that, Father?

00:14:30.980 --> 00:14:33.890
It took me five years to learn these techniques.

00:14:34.820 --> 00:14:35.890
Five years?

00:14:36.930 --> 00:14:38.730
There's no time to waste!

00:14:39.020 --> 00:14:40.320
I understand!

00:14:40.320 --> 00:14:43.470
Th-This is so wonderful, Father!

00:14:44.120 --> 00:14:47.390
You have placed me in a dire situation

00:14:47.390 --> 00:14:51.160
in order to spur me on, haven't you?

00:14:51.160 --> 00:14:52.740
Thank you very much!

00:14:53.310 --> 00:14:56.750
I shall meet your expectations!

00:15:03.530 --> 00:15:04.420
Here I go!

00:15:04.890 --> 00:15:06.420
<i>Fuji Hammer!</i>

00:15:12.060 --> 00:15:14.100
I cut it...

00:15:37.120 --> 00:15:38.440
Honestly...

00:15:38.810 --> 00:15:43.380
No sustenance or sleep for two days, 
and he finally collapses.

00:15:47.560 --> 00:15:48.170
Kanae!

00:15:49.380 --> 00:15:53.550
He learns fast, perhaps thanks to your blood.

00:15:55.150 --> 00:15:57.680
Maybe I'll sing you one of her lullabies...

00:16:00.540 --> 00:16:08.680
<i>Uzumasa took his blade,</i>

00:16:08.680 --> 00:16:15.370
<i>and he slew the greatest of 
the Eternal Land's gods...</i>

00:16:25.220 --> 00:16:27.570
Wh-Wh-What?!

00:16:28.960 --> 00:16:30.880
<i>I can't believe this...</i>

00:16:30.880 --> 00:16:32.680
<i>While I slept,</i>

00:16:32.680 --> 00:16:35.170
<i>lava covered the stone I was using as a marker!</i>

00:16:35.800 --> 00:16:37.930
Now, what will you do, Jinbei?

00:16:38.420 --> 00:16:40.320
The lava won't wait.

00:16:40.860 --> 00:16:43.310
You probably have one last chance.

00:16:56.480 --> 00:16:58.150
<i>I have one chance.</i>

00:16:58.730 --> 00:17:02.490
<i>If I fail, the people at Mt. Fuji's base will die.</i>

00:17:05.340 --> 00:17:08.820
<i>Father's taught me everything I need.</i>

00:17:10.090 --> 00:17:12.620
<i>A samurai is always ready for a fight.</i>

00:17:12.620 --> 00:17:15.880
<i>You never know when 
you're about to go into battle.</i>

00:17:19.890 --> 00:17:21.530
This is a battlefield...

00:17:23.530 --> 00:17:26.100
It always has been!

00:17:27.600 --> 00:17:30.110
I am Tsukishima Jinbei! Here I go!

00:17:40.470 --> 00:17:41.370
<i>There it is.</i>

00:17:45.310 --> 00:17:46.870
<i>I will do this!</i>

00:17:46.870 --> 00:17:49.700
<i>And become far, far stronger...</i>

00:17:49.700 --> 00:17:52.130
<i>To protect the people of Edo!</i>

00:17:52.660 --> 00:17:56.260
<i>And so that one day, I can keep that promise!</i>

00:17:56.800 --> 00:17:58.010
<i>Stronger...</i>

00:17:59.540 --> 00:18:03.100
<i>Tsukishima-style: Fuji Hammer!</i>

00:18:07.170 --> 00:18:09.780
<i>On a battlefield, you cannot merely slash a foe.</i>

00:18:09.780 --> 00:18:12.270
<i>You must crush them to the end!</i>

00:18:18.940 --> 00:18:20.070
I did it...

00:18:20.360 --> 00:18:21.490
I did it!

00:18:21.490 --> 00:18:23.930
I did it! I finally mastered―

00:18:27.290 --> 00:18:28.430
Watch.

00:18:29.910 --> 00:18:30.950
Father?

00:18:31.730 --> 00:18:33.150
<i>Tsukishima Style:</i>

00:18:34.420 --> 00:18:37.590
<i>Fuji Storm!</i>

00:18:46.090 --> 00:18:47.900
What is this, Father?

00:18:47.900 --> 00:18:50.950
The next technique you were to learn...

00:18:50.950 --> 00:18:53.130
But you're out of time.

00:18:53.790 --> 00:18:56.010
I'm t-terribly sorry...

00:18:56.960 --> 00:18:58.790
But I will master the technique

00:18:58.790 --> 00:19:04.250
you just demonstrated, and I 
will continue my training!

00:19:15.940 --> 00:19:17.010
<i>Jinbei-sama?</i>

00:19:17.900 --> 00:19:21.180
<i>You're leaving for training
 tomorrow morning, right?</i>

00:19:21.180 --> 00:19:23.080
<i>Shouldn't you be resting?</i>

00:19:23.080 --> 00:19:24.310
<i>No...</i>

00:19:24.310 --> 00:19:29.580
<i>I must be as strong as possible for 
Edo and the Insect Magistrate.</i>

00:19:31.980 --> 00:19:35.160
<i>My rank and position are far 
beneath the Magistrate's,</i>

00:19:35.160 --> 00:19:38.070
<i>so they said it wouldn't be easy to meet.</i>

00:19:39.890 --> 00:19:41.130
<i>That's right...</i>

00:19:41.720 --> 00:19:45.800
<i>If I meet Tsukishima and the others find out,</i>

00:19:45.800 --> 00:19:49.040
<i>that would be terrible for him.</i>

00:19:50.090 --> 00:19:53.410
<i>Our ranks and positions are too far apart.</i>

00:19:54.440 --> 00:19:59.130
<i>But some day, I will meet the Magistrate.</i>

00:19:59.720 --> 00:20:05.050
<i>I'll get stronger, so I can meet the Magistrate!</i>

00:20:07.790 --> 00:20:11.100
<i>I promised that servant</i>

00:20:11.480 --> 00:20:15.640
<i>that we would all see 
the blue sky of Edo together.</i>

00:20:19.970 --> 00:20:21.860
<i>Just wait for me,</i>

00:20:22.170 --> 00:20:23.790
<i>Magistrate!</i>

