Servants of the Tokugawa Magistrate,

00:21:09.490 --> 00:21:12.650
your era will end with the next winter.

00:21:13.640 --> 00:21:16.360
<b>Sanada Yukimura</b>

00:21:14.380 --> 00:21:16.380
